{
  "id": "Lyo.FileStorage.Sftp",
  "name": "Lyo.FileStorage.Sftp",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "`IFileStorageService` on SFTP through Lyo.Sftp.Client.",
  "description": "Lyo.FileStorage physical-IO backend for SFTP. Save, read, delete, copy, move, and DEK header rotation work. v1 does not implement presigned URLs or multipart (the base throws NotSupportedException).",
  "features": [
    "**Shared remote storage core.** `SFTPFileStorageService` subclasses `RemoteFileStorageServiceBase` in `Lyo.FileStorage`, which already covers streaming, encryption-header handling, copy/move, and health. What this package adds is `SftpRemoteFileTransport` (`IRemoteFileTransport` over `Lyo.Sftp.Client`), plus options and DI.",
    "**SFTP physical IO.** Commit-on-close upload and a leased read stream.",
    "**Path jail.** POSIX paths rooted at `Sftp.RootRemoteDirectory`.",
    "**DI.** `AddSftpFileStorageService` and `AddSftpFileStorageServiceFromConfiguration`, matching the Blob extensions."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "DI setup",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddSftpFileStorageService(o =>\n{\n    o.Sftp.Host = \"sftp.example.com\";\n    o.Sftp.Username = \"lyo\";\n    o.Sftp.Password = secret;\n    o.Sftp.RootRemoteDirectory = \"/files\";\n    o.Sftp.HostKeyPolicy = SftpHostKeyPolicy.FingerprintAllowList;\n    o.Sftp.AllowedHostKeyFingerprints.Add(\"SHA256:...\");\n});"
    }
  ],
